  "fullDescription": "Amour Retro is a Graffiti Cartoon font designed to heighten the individuality of your brand.\n\nThis versatile typeface is ideally suited for creating iconic logos, dynamic comic book scripts, memorable watermarks, eye-catching posters, powerful promotions, and customized product packaging. Amour Retro effortlessly transitions each letter into an expressive statement piece that exudes the lively spirit of Graffiti Cartoon.\n\nAmour Retro Font kit provides two font styles – regular and extrude, encouraging your creative freedom to explore and develop your distinct style. The font has a full graffiti gallery including uppercase, lowercase letters, numerals, and punctuation, infusing the cartoon spirit into every keystroke. Use the previews above to let your imagination fly as you shape your brand story with vigor and personality.\n\nLet Amour Retro's unmatched vibrancy gear up your designs to remarkable, undiscovered levels. Embrace its allure, and let it be your guide on your typography adventure.\n\nThe font is also PUA-encoded, ensuring effortless access to all glyphs, swashes, and alternate characters to help you customize your creations with ease.",
